WEBVTT

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:09.051
(ENCHANTING MUSIC PLAYING)

00:00:09.135 --> 00:00:10.178
(GASPS IN AWE)

00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:19.145
Huh?

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:20.271
(GRUNTING)

00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.439
DANIELA: Luca!

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:23.858
Lunch is ready!

00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:25.276
Be right there!

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.909
Come on! We gotta get back.

00:00:36.829 --> 00:00:37.830
DANIELA: You're two minutes late.

00:00:37.914 --> 00:00:39.081
-Was there a boat? Huh?
-LUCA: Uh...

00:00:39.165 --> 00:00:40.249
-Did you hide?
-Yes, Mom.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.835
Because if they catch
even a glimpse of you...

00:00:42.919 --> 00:00:44.754
You think they come around
to meet new friends, huh?

00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:46.297
-No.
-Make small talk.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.381
-I... I don't.
-No.

00:00:47.465 --> 00:00:48.966
-They're here to do murders.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:50.134
So, I'm just making sure you know.

00:00:50.218 --> 00:00:51.219
Thanks, Mom.

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:52.303
When I was a kid,

00:00:52.386 --> 00:00:54.138
we'd go weeks without seeing a boat,

00:00:54.222 --> 00:00:56.182
and let me tell you,
they did not have motors.

00:00:56.265 --> 00:00:58.768
Just a sweaty land monster with a paddle.

00:00:58.851 --> 00:01:00.937
-Hi, Grandma. Mwah.
-Hey, Bubble.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:02.313
-Hi, Dad.
-Luca!

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:05.483
Look at Pinchy-pessa. She's molting.

00:01:05.775 --> 00:01:07.860
-Oh, it's magnificent.
-(SQUEAKS)

00:01:07.944 --> 00:01:11.155
Now, here's a champion
show crab if I ever saw one.

00:01:11.239 --> 00:01:12.949
-Oh, nice.
-Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:01:13.032 --> 00:01:14.784
-Don't look her in the eye!
-Sorry.

00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:17.995
But don't apologize.
She can sense weakness.

00:01:18.079 --> 00:01:19.205
-(SNAPS)
-Oh!

00:01:19.872 --> 00:01:21.249
Come eat, Luca. Come on.

00:01:21.374 --> 00:01:24.085
We better beat those Branzinos
at the crab show this year.

00:01:24.168 --> 00:01:27.171
Everyone thinks Bianca Branzino's so great

00:01:27.255 --> 00:01:28.756
with her prize-winning crabs

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:31.759
and amazing dolphin impression. Please!

00:01:31.843 --> 00:01:33.219
Anyone can do that.

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:34.554
(MIMICS DOLPHIN TRILLING)

00:01:34.637 --> 00:01:35.638
Right?

00:01:35.721 --> 00:01:37.807
I don't know why dolphins
even sound like that.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.642
You know, why don't they just talk?

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:40.726
-Luca.
-Huh?

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.186
GRANDMA PAGURO: What's on your mind?

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:45.439
Uh... Uh... Well, I was just wondering...

00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:47.316
Where do boats come from?

00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:48.734
(COUGHS)

00:01:48.818 --> 00:01:51.571
The land monster town.
Just above the surface.

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:53.823
I beat a guy at cards there once.

00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:55.700
-(LUCA GASPS)
-Mom! What are you doing?

00:01:55.783 --> 00:01:57.827
He's old enough to hear about it.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.329
You've been to the surface
and done the change?

00:02:00.413 --> 00:02:02.331
No! No! The end! Shut it down!

00:02:02.415 --> 00:02:04.292
I was just curious.

00:02:04.375 --> 00:02:06.794
Yeah? Well, the curious fish gets caught.

00:02:06.878 --> 00:02:09.380
We do not talk, think,
discuss, contemplate,

00:02:09.463 --> 00:02:12.049
or go anywhere near the surface! Got it?

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:13.301
Yes, Mom.

00:02:13.384 --> 00:02:15.511
Here. Now let's get back to work.

00:02:19.682 --> 00:02:21.100
Hey.

00:02:22.768 --> 00:02:24.270
Look me in the eye.

00:02:24.353 --> 00:02:26.355
You know I love you, right?

00:02:26.439 --> 00:02:27.690
I know, Mom.

00:02:31.694 --> 00:02:33.863
We're a little worried about him, right?

00:02:33.946 --> 00:02:36.073
No, thanks! I'm full.

00:02:39.452 --> 00:02:41.537
(SOFT INSTRUMENTAL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:45.374 --> 00:02:46.501
Huh?

00:02:52.632 --> 00:02:53.758
Hmm.

00:02:56.636 --> 00:02:57.678
(GASPS)

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:03.768
(GASPS)

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:06.646
Whoa.

00:03:08.356 --> 00:03:09.482
Hmm.

00:03:10.441 --> 00:03:11.442
Hmm.

00:03:13.528 --> 00:03:15.530
(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:19.075 --> 00:03:20.493
(SCREAMS)

00:03:20.576 --> 00:03:22.703
(GRUNTS AND GROANS)

00:03:23.246 --> 00:03:24.997
(WHIMPERING)

00:03:28.251 --> 00:03:29.293
VOICE: (OVER HELMET) Boo.

00:03:29.377 --> 00:03:30.419
LUCA: Huh?

00:03:30.503 --> 00:03:32.672
It's fine. I'm not human.

00:03:32.755 --> 00:03:34.632
Oh! (CHUCKLES) Thank goodness.

00:03:35.174 --> 00:03:36.509
-Here, hold this.
-(GASPS)

00:03:41.305 --> 00:03:44.225
Uh... Do you live around here?

00:03:44.308 --> 00:03:47.061
Down here? No, no, no.
I just came for my stuff.

00:03:47.144 --> 00:03:48.145
Ooh.

00:03:49.146 --> 00:03:51.566
Uh, hey! Wait, that's mine!

00:03:56.612 --> 00:03:58.823
Sir? You forgot your harpoon and...

00:03:58.906 --> 00:04:00.283
Oh, yeah. Thanks!

00:04:00.366 --> 00:04:02.160
LUCA: What? What are you doing?

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:03.661
(GASPS)

00:04:04.829 --> 00:04:06.205
(YELPING)

00:04:06.289 --> 00:04:07.623
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:04:08.374 --> 00:04:09.709
(GASPS AND SCREAMS)

00:04:09.792 --> 00:04:10.793
No, no!

00:04:10.877 --> 00:04:12.795
Ahh! Oh, no!

00:04:12.879 --> 00:04:14.881
(CRYING OUT)

00:04:14.964 --> 00:04:16.090
Help me!

00:04:16.591 --> 00:04:17.925
First time?

00:04:18.092 --> 00:04:21.220
Of course it is! I'm a good kid!

00:04:21.304 --> 00:04:22.722
-(WHIMPERS)
-Hey, relax.

00:04:22.805 --> 00:04:23.848
Breathe.

00:04:24.348 --> 00:04:26.350
(BREATHING HEAVILY)

00:04:26.434 --> 00:04:28.144
(WAVE CRASHING GENTLY)

00:04:30.021 --> 00:04:32.023
(TRANQUIL MUSIC PLAYING)

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.531
(INSECT CHIRRING)

00:04:40.615 --> 00:04:42.575
(SEAGULLS SQUAWKING)

00:04:42.658 --> 00:04:43.910
(LUCA GASPS IN AWE)

00:04:46.704 --> 00:04:47.705
Whoa.

00:04:47.788 --> 00:04:50.708
Well? Isn't it great?

00:04:50.791 --> 00:04:51.792
No!

00:04:51.876 --> 00:04:54.754
It's bad, and I'm not
supposed to be up here.

00:04:55.129 --> 00:04:56.130
Good day.

00:04:56.214 --> 00:04:57.298
(WATER SPLASHES)

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:03.638
Thank you.

00:05:05.681 --> 00:05:07.892
Good... Good day. Again.

00:05:16.192 --> 00:05:17.193
Grandma,

00:05:18.027 --> 00:05:19.278
did you really go up to the...

00:05:19.362 --> 00:05:20.530
(SNORES HURRIEDLY)

00:05:34.001 --> 00:05:37.922
Okay, everyone. This is, uh, Smuca.

00:05:38.089 --> 00:05:41.008
Yeah. He's in charge now. Got it?

00:05:42.051 --> 00:05:43.052
(BLEATS)

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:52.603
(GRUNTING)

00:05:52.687 --> 00:05:53.688
(SIGHS)

00:05:55.356 --> 00:05:56.649
(EXHALES SHARPLY)

00:06:00.444 --> 00:06:02.029
(GRUNTING)

00:06:02.113 --> 00:06:03.447
(SIGHS)

00:06:03.531 --> 00:06:04.740
-Wow.
-Aah!

00:06:04.824 --> 00:06:06.242
That was hard to watch.

00:06:06.325 --> 00:06:07.326
Here.

00:06:07.785 --> 00:06:08.786
Come on.

00:06:13.291 --> 00:06:14.417
(EXHALES DEEPLY)

